     "speakers": [],
     "has_duration": false
    },
    {
     "id": "BAC009S0002W0139",
     "lang": "zh",
     "text": "支持缴存职工购买手套和改善型自住住房。",
     "err": 0.0556,
     "n_seg": 0,
     "speakers": [],
     "has_duration": false
    },
    {
     "id": "1320-122612-0001",
     "lang": "en",
     "text": "The dews were suffered to exhale, and the sun had dispersed the mists and was shedding a strong and clear light in the forest when the travellers resumed their journey.",
